{"version":1,"content":"<p>麥沛東有份參演的HOY處境劇《你的保安 李寶安》收視報捷，他昨晚（30日）首演舞台劇後受訪，他表示不敢說自己功不可沒，歸功於導演何爵天，「他是領頭人，我只是小薯仔，聽從導演指示，怎樣去和李尚正對抗，大家都知正哥是急才王，忍笑到好辛苦。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.378265+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T07:46:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.793717+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.063488+00:00","content_hash":"9055be31fffd0fd786c69bf1b0211a482653f9d366f367f305a37ab5e9a62c4f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}